msgid "The URL for (POST) requests to create and resolve PIDs."
msgstr "URL:en för (POST) begär att skapa och matcha PID:er."

#: components/administration/forms.py:72
msgid "Web service key"
msgstr "Webbtjänstnyckel"

#: components/administration/forms.py:74
msgid ""
"Web service key needed for authentication to make PID-binding requests to "
"the PID web service endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Webservicenyckel nödvändig vid autentitisering för att göra PID-bindnings "
"begäran till PID-webservice endpoint."

#: components/administration/forms.py:81
msgid "Naming authority"
msgstr "Naming authority"

#: components/administration/forms.py:82
msgid "Handle naming authority (e.g., 12345)"
msgstr "Handle naming authority (t. ex. 12345)"

#: components/administration/forms.py:87
msgid "Resolver URL"
msgstr "Resolver URL"

#: components/administration/forms.py:89
msgid ""
"The URL to append generated PIDs to in order to create (potentially "
"qualified) PURLs (persistent URLs) that resolve to the applicable resolve "
"URL. Note the second \"r\" in \"resolver\"!"
msgstr ""
"URL att fästa vid genererade PID:er för att skapa (potentiellt "
"kvalificerade) PURL (persistent URLs) som går till den tillämpbara resolve "
"URL:en. Notera det andra \"r\"et i \"resolver\"!"

#: components/administration/forms.py:100
msgid "AIP PID source"
msgstr "AIP PID-källa"

#: components/administration/forms.py:102
msgid ""
"The source of the AIP's persistent identifier. The UUID of the AIP is the "
"default since it is virtually guaranteed to be unique. However, the "
"accession number of the transfer may be used, assuming the user can "
"guarantee a 1-to-1 relationship between the transfer and the AIP."
msgstr ""
"Källan till AIP:ens ständiga identifierare. AIP:ens UUID är standard "
"eftersom det virtuellt är garanterat att den är unik. Hursomhelst så kan "
"överföringens accessionsnummer komma att användas, förutsatt att användaren "
"kan garantera ett 1-till-1 förhållande melan överföringen och AIP:n."

#: components/administration/forms.py:117
msgid "Verify SSL certificates"
msgstr "Kontrollera SSL certifikat"

#: components/administration/forms.py:118
msgid "Verify SSL certificates when making requests to bind PIDs."
msgstr "Kontrollera SSL-certifikat när begäran om att låsa PID görs."

#: components/administration/forms.py:123
msgid "Archive resolve URL template"
msgstr "Resolve URL-mall för arkiv."

#: components/administration/forms.py:125
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) for the URL that a unit's PURL should resolve "
"to. Has access to \"pid\" and \"naming_authority\" variables."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) för det URL som en enhets PURL bör lösa till. Har "
"tillgång till \"pid\" och \"naming_authority\" variablerna."

#: components/administration/forms.py:133
msgid "METS resolve URL template"
msgstr "Resolve URL-mall för METS."

#: components/administration/forms.py:135
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) for the URL that a unit's PURL with the \"mets\" "
"qualifier should resolve to. Has access to \"pid\" and \"naming_authority\" "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) för det URL som en enhets PURL med bestämningen "
"\"mets\" bör lösa till. Har tillgång till \"pid\" och \"naming_authority\" "
"variablerna."

#: components/administration/forms.py:143
msgid "File resolve URL template"
msgstr "Resolve URL-mall för filer."

#: components/administration/forms.py:145
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) for the URL that a file's PURL should resolve "
"to. Has access to \"pid\" and \"naming_authority\" variables."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) för det URL som en fils PURL bör lösa till. Har "
"tillgång till \"pid\" och \"naming_authority\" variablerna."

#: components/administration/forms.py:153
msgid "Access derivative resolve URL template"
msgstr "Resolve URL-mall för lösning av URL för åtkomstbearbetning"

#: components/administration/forms.py:155
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) for the URL that a file's PURL with the "
"\"access\" qualifier should resolve to. Has access to \"pid\" and "
"\"naming_authority\" variables."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) för den URL som en fils PURL med bestämningen "
"\"åtkomst\" bör lösa mot. Har tillgång till variablerna \"pid\" och "
"\"naming_authority\"."

#: components/administration/forms.py:163
msgid "Preservation derivative resolve URL template"
msgstr "Resolve URL-mall för bevarandebearbetning"

#: components/administration/forms.py:165
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) for the URL that a file's PURL with the "
"\"preservation\" qualifier should resolve to. Has access to \"pid\" and "
"\"naming_authority\" variables."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) för det URL som en filss PURL med bestämningen "
"\"bevarande\" bör lösa till. Har tillgång till \"pid\" och "
"\"naming_authority\" variablerna."

#: components/administration/forms.py:174
msgid "Original file resolve URL template"
msgstr "Ursprunglig resolve URL mall för filer."

#: components/administration/forms.py:176
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) for the URL that a file's PURL with the "
"\"original\" qualifier should resolve to. Has access to \"pid\" and "
"\"naming_authority\" variables."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) för den URL som en fils PURL med bestämningen "
"\"original\" bör lösa mot. Har tillgång till variablerna \"pid\" och "
"\"naming_authority\"."

#: components/administration/forms.py:185
msgid "PID/handle request request body template"
msgstr "PID/hantera begäran brödtextsmall"

#: components/administration/forms.py:187
msgid ""
"Template (Django or Jinja2) that constructs the HTTP request body using the "
"rendered URL templates above. Has access to the following variables: "
"\"pid\", \"naming_authority\", \"base_resolve_url\", and "
"\"qualified_resolve_urls\", the last of which is a list of dicts with "
"\"url\" and \"qualifier\" keys."
msgstr ""
"Mall (Django eller Jinja2) som konstruerar HTTP begärandets brödtext genom "
"att använda de framställda URL-mallarna ovan. Har tillgång till variablerna "
"\"pid\", \"naming_authority\", \"base_resolve_url\", and "
"\"qualified_resolve_urls\". Den sista av dessa är en lista med dicts med "
"nycklarna \"url\" och \"qualifier\"."

